{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They say there's a chance to escape the backrooms in the 100th day. Will you succeed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate terrifying levels with numerous dangers and entities lurking around every corner. Watch out for your sanity as you explore the strangest levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/7754e01cc5a6a905a4bd9d388e9c7f04.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 levels with different ways to escape, different dangers and different environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/b5a04959985fb513b00cf52c9e9814a7.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 entities with different behaviors , abilities and appearance. All of them are accurate to the wiki and you always have to use different strategies to go forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/5d5b20a2cc182b0272996bb3989de77a.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Play alone or in a total of 6 players Co-op, Explore the backrooms but at the same time be careful of the dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/64e11a3b8654c6f56bf7a92a78f222f0.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine 5 guarantees beautiful graphics with stunning environments and scenarios.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/369424ac6b0df8e0d3e72fadd380b483.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The liminal mode is a walking simulator gamemode for the people that want vhs liminal vibes, no monsters but just unsettling liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.poster.avif?t=1761847275\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.webm?t=1761847275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.mp4?t=1761847275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/d7b20a693c9129ea367c58b98190bd2a.avif?t=1761847275\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity chat to talk to your friends and fully immerse yourself in the experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First of many...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964500/e8be97e0ce34728ef9e7b6d4fb38386670119843.jpg"},{"name":"That's a lot of doors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964500/3828bedcd83cd8d7609514be4b2e762c286df24b.jpg"},{"name":"Pipe Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964500/f3013bcd05748bd3d0987991b82ba2576eb3fe0d.jpg"},{"name":"Had fun? =)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964500/0a2a6db5575e62e5a673b0e616e791bac24cf7b4.jpg"},{"name":"RUN FO